OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FThe cops deal with a suicidal man
OL,7,     Fwith mental health problems, an
OL,8,     FEritrean woman dumped out of a
OL,9,     Florry by people traffickers, and a
OL,10,     Flass who's had a barney with her
OL,11,     Fboyfriend.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FBen and Matt find themselves on a
OL,14,     Fhigh-speed pursuit which ends up
OL,15,     Fon a road to nowhere.
OL,16,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,17,     FSteve rides to the aid of the
OL,18,     Farmed response team after reports
OL,19,     Fof a man drawing a gun on a pizza
OL,20,     Fdelivery driver. Charley and Wayne
OL,21,     Ftake away a drink driver at the
