OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     F28-year-old Kirsten wants to get
OL,7,     Frid of a cyst on her stomach that
OL,8,     Fshe thinks looks like a third
OL,9,     Fnipple, while 63-year-old Julie
OL,10,     Fhas two lumps on her back that
OL,11,     Fcould be cysts or lipomas.
