OL,13,     FLisa and Jack respond to a
OL,14,     Fhorrifying call after a former
OL,15,     Fcolleague has been bitten by
OL,16,     Fout-of-control dogs. And the JRU
OL,17,     Finvestigate reports of a
OL,18,     Fshop-lifting incident at a garage
OL,19,     Fshop.
